# CRM Dashboard UI Design

A modern CRM (Customer Relationship Management) Dashboard UI designed for small agencies and B2B service-based businesses.

## Project Overview

This project focuses on designing a clean and user-friendly CRM dashboard that helps businesses manage leads, clients, and tasks efficiently.

The dashboard provides a centralized view of client relationships, lead progress, and follow-up activities.

## Features

## 1. Dashboard Overview
- Business activity summary
- Client statistics
- Task overview
- Quick access navigation

## 2. Lead Pipeline Management
- Track leads through different stages
- Manage lead status
- Visual pipeline workflow

Lead stages include:
- New Leads
- Contacted
- Proposal Sent
- Negotiation
- Won / Lost

## 3. Client Management
- Client list view
- Client profile details
- Company information
- Project status tracking

## 4. Tasks & Follow-ups
- Task management
- Follow-up reminders
- Priority tracking
- Task status monitoring

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Figma (UI Design & Prototyping)

